list.item:
Anderson, Robert
                                B., Deputy Secretary of Defense until August 1955;
                        Secretary of the Treasury from July 1957

person.note:
Director of the Policy Planning Staff, Department of State, until August 1955;
                    Assistant Secretary of State for Policy Planning, August 1955– August
                    1957

Senior United Nations Command Member of the Military Armistice Commission;
                    also Chief of the U.S. Provisional Military Assistance and Advisory Group,
                    Korea
